(5) Integrated prevention efforts of Violence, Exploitation and Discrimination against women as referred to in paragraph (1) are coordinated by the Regional Apparatus that administers governmental affairs in the field of women's empowerment and child protection as well as governmental affairs in the field of population control and family planning.
